@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "Config Result OK" as ok
ok : Solar admission evaluated normally
state "Dependent config fault" as fault
fault : admission = Unknown(SettingsFault)
fault : (even if a fault branch is true;\nno old value or default used)
state "Recovery baseline" as base
base : missed starts are NOT caught up
[*] --> ok
ok --> fault : current observation is a fault
fault --> base : later successful observation
base --> ok : next eligible crossing\ncan fire once
@enduml
